WEBVTT

00:02:58.979 --> 00:03:00.896
the smartphone with the add-on clip

00:03:00.896 --> 00:03:02.577
is comparable to a camera

00:03:02.577 --> 00:03:04.472
that is hugely more expensive

00:03:04.472 --> 00:03:08.061
and hugely more difficult to transport.

00:03:08.061 --> 00:03:09.940
When we first moved to Kenya,

00:03:09.940 --> 00:03:12.593
we went with 150,000 dollars of equipment,

00:03:12.593 --> 00:03:15.050
a team of 15 people,

00:03:15.050 --> 00:03:17.942
and that was what was
needed to deliver health care.

00:03:17.942 --> 00:03:20.307
Now, all that's needed

00:03:20.307 --> 00:03:22.099
is a single person

00:03:22.099 --> 00:03:25.495
on a bike with a smartphone.

00:03:25.495 --> 00:03:29.349
And it costs just 500 dollars.

00:03:29.349 --> 00:03:31.219
The issue of power supply